.kind%3D%3D%3D%27string%27%26%26event.key%26%26event.value%3D%3D%3D%27lexical%27%29awaitLexical%3Dtrue%3B%0A%20%20%20%20else%20if%28awaitLexical%29%7Bassert.equal%28event.kind%2C%27array%27%29%3BlexicalDepth%3Devent.depth%3BawaitLexical%3Dfalse%3B%7D%0A%20%20%20%20else%20if%28event.kind%3D%3D%3D%27number%27%26%26lexicalDepth%21%3D%3Dnull%29occurrences.push%28ordinal%29%3B%0A%20%20%7D%0A%20%20assert.equal%28occurrences.length%2C6%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20observations%3Dvalues.map%28%28value%2Cindex%29%3D%3E%7B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20buffer%3DBuffer.alloc%288%29%3Bbuffer.writeDoubleBE%28value%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20return%7BwireOccurrence%3Aoccurrences%5Bindex%5D%2Csigned%3Aindex%3C3%2Cunsigned%3Aindex%3D%3D%3D0%7C%7Cindex%3D%3D%3D2%2Cfloating%3Aindex%3E%3D3%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20signedDecimal%3Aindex%3C3%3FBigInt%28value%29.toString%28%29%3Anull%2CunsignedDecimal%3Aindex%3D%3D%3D0%7C%7Cindex%3D%3D%3D2%3FBigInt%28value%29.toString%28%29%3Anull%2CfloatingBits%3Abuffer.toString%28%27hex%27%29%7D%3B%0A%20%20%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20fixture%3D%7BschemaVersion%3A1%2CnumberVersions%3A%7Bminimum%3A%271.0.151%27%2CmaximumExclusive%3A%271.0.152%27%2CexcludedFeature%3A%27arbitrary_precision%27%2ClockSource%3Apin%28lockSource%29%7D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20observations%2CexpandedOccurrences%3Aordinal%2C%0A%20%20%20%20boundary%3A%27Independent%20explicit%20native%20variant%20expectations%20for%20one%20constructed%20six-number%20lexical%20array.%20These%20are%20test%20inputs%20and%20expected%20observations%2C%20not%20actual%20native%20execution.%20Primitive%20usize%20positions%20are%20excluded%3B%20original%20native%20predicates%20and%20payloads%20require%20CI%20execution.%27%7D%3B%0A%20%20const%20receiptFile%3Dnew%20URL%28%27..%2F..%2F..%2F..%2Fparity%2Fself-translation%2Foriginal-native-number-observations.lino%27%2Cimport.meta.url%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20fixtureFile%3Dnew%20URL%28%27..%2F..%2F..%2F..%2Fparity%2Ffixtures%2Foriginal-native-number-observations.lino%27%2Cimport.meta.url%29%3B%0A%