ows.rs%22%5D%5Cnmod%20storage%3B%27%2Cto%3A%27%23%5Bpath%20%3D%20%22..%2F..%2F..%2Fexperiments%2Fgrammar-outcome-network%2Fnative-transport%2Finverse%2Fstatic-borrows.rs%22%5D%5Cnmod%20storage%3B%5Cnuse%20storage%3A%3Arules%3B%27%7D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%7Bfrom%3A%271048576.0%27%2Cto%3A%271_048_576.0%27%7D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%7Bfrom%3A%271048577.0%27%2Cto%3A%271_048_577.0%27%7D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%7Bfrom%3A%27repeat%281048577%29%27%2Cto%3A%27repeat%281_048_577%29%27%7D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%29%7B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20original%3DcaptureGitArtifactCertificate%28revision%2Cfile%29%2CsourceText%3Doriginal.blob.toString%28%27utf8%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20verifyGitArtifactCertificate%28original.certificate%2Coriginal.blob%2C%7Brevision%2Cpath%3Afile%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20current%3DreadFileSync%28new%20URL%28file%2Croot%29%2C%27utf8%27%29%3Blet%20corrected%3DsourceText%3B%0A%20%20%20%20for%28const%20action%20of%20actions%29%7Bassert.equal%28corrected.split%28action.from%29.length%2C2%29%3Bcorrected%3Dcorrected.replace%28action.from%2Caction.to%29%3B%7D%0A%20%20%20%20assert.equal%28corrected%2Ccurrent%2C%27only%20the%20observed%20module%20ownership%20and%20literal%20spelling%20repairs%20are%20admitted%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20let%20inverse%3Dcurrent%3Bfor%28const%20action%20of%20%5B...actions%5D.reverse%28%29%29%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20assert.equal%28inverse.split%28action.to%29.length%2C2%29%3Binverse%3Dinverse.replace%28action.to%2Caction.from%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%20%20%20%20assert.equal%28inverse%2CsourceText%2C%27all%20original%20source%20inputs%20and%20assertions%20survive%20exact%20inverse%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20sources.push%28%7Bfile%2Ccommit%3Arevision%2C...pin%28original.blob%29%2CsourceText%2Ccertificate%3Aoriginal.certificate%2Ccurrent%3Apin%28current%29%2Cactions%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20%7D%0A%20%20const%20adapter%3Dsources%5B0%5D%2CcurrentAdapter%3DreadFileSync%28new%20URL%28adapter.file%2Croot%29%2C%27utf8%27%29%3B%0A%20%20assert.equal%28readSourceTextRustBlock%28adapter.sourceText%2C%27fn%27%2C%27resolve_owned_outcome_static_borrow%27%29%2C%0A%20%20%20%20readSourceTextRustBlock%28currentAdapter%2C%27fn%27%2C%27resolve_owned_outcome_static_borrow%27%29%2C%27the%20complete%20actual%20storage%20algorithm%20and%20lifetime%20signature%20remain%20byte%20exact%27%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20unchanged%3D%5B%27rust%2Fsrc%2Ftranslation%2Fowned_outcome_static_borrow_rules.rs%27%2C%27rust%2Fsrc%2Ftranslation%2Fowned_outcome_static_borrow_rules%2Fpart_1.rs%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%27parity%2Ffixtures%2Fgrammar-outcome-static-borrows.lino%27%5D.map%28file%3D%3E%7B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20original%3DcaptureGitArtifactCertificate%28revision%2Cfile%29%2Ccurrent%3DreadFileSync%28new%20URL%28file%2Croot%29%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20assert.ok%28current.equals%28original.blob%29%29%3Breturn%7Bfile%2C...pin%28current%29%7D%3B%0A%20%20%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20history%3D%7BschemaVersion%3A1%2Crevision%2Csources%2Cunchanged%2C%0A%20%20%20%20observedLintDiagnostics%3A%7Brun%3A39359700443%2Cjob%3A118431586371%2ClogBytes%3A200564%2ClogSha256%3A%278d6f8c7e9b9c62c2f138704db97e9c63b9a71943c84681390efcaf0f1c729feb%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20lints%3A%5B%27duplicate_mod%27%2C%27unreadable_literal%27%5D%2CliteralValues%3A%5B1048576%2C1048577%5D%7D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20boundary%3A%27One%20actual%20generated%20native%20rule%20module%20supplies%20both%20direct%20controls%20and%20typed%20static%20storage.%20Only%20visibility%20within%20its%20parent%2C%20an%20actual%20module%20alias%20and%20separator%20spellings%20change%3B%20every%20original%20test%20input%20assertion%20native%20algorithm%20and%20existing%20static%20lifetime%20remain.%20Native%20execution%20still%20requires%20CI.%27%7D%3B%0A%20%20const%20output%3Dnew%20URL%28%27..%2F..%2F..%2F..%2Fparity%2Fself-translation%2Fstatic-borrow-module-source-history.lino%27%2Cimport.meta.url%29%3B%0A%20%20if%28check%29checkProjectData%28output%2Chistory%29%3Belse%20writeProjectData%28output%2Chistory%29%3