(56188: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %2F%2F%21%20Bidirectional%20enforcement%20of%20the%20shared%20Rust%20%3C-%3E%20JavaScript%20parity%20manifest.%0A%2F%2F%21%0A%2F%2F%21%20%60parity%2Flanguage-features.lino%60%20is%20the%20single%20source%20of%20truth%20for%20the%0A%2F%2F%21%20feature%20set%20both%20language%20implementations%20must%20keep%20in%20sync.%20The%20JavaScript%0A%2F%2F%21%20side%20validates%20it%20with%20%60js%2Fscripts%2Fcheck-js-rust-parity.mjs%60%3B%20this%20test%20gives%0A%2F%2F%21%20the%20Rust%20side%20an%20equivalent%20guard%20so%20the%20Rust%20test%20suite%20itself%20fails%20when%20the%0A%2F%2F%21%20manifest%20and%20the%20crate%27s%20public%20API%20drift%20apart.%20Together%20they%20implement%20the%0A%2F%2F%21%20issue%20%23163%20rule%3A%20a%20feature%20added%20to%20one%20language%20forces%20the%20other%20to%20follow.%0A%0Ause%20std%3A%3Afs%3B%0Ause%20std%3A%3Apath%3A%3A%7BComponent%2C%20Path%2C%20PathBuf%7D%3B%0A%0Ause%20meta_language%3A%3AAPI_OPERATIONS%3B%0Ause%20serde_json%3A%3AValue%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%2F%20Walk%20up%20from%20the%20crate%20manifest%20to%20the%20repository%20root%20that%20owns%20the%20shared%0A%2F%2F%2F%20%60parity%2F%60%20directory.%20The%20Rust%20crate%20lives%20under%20%60rust%2F%60%20in%20the%20multi-language%0A%2F%2F%2F%20layout%2C%20while%20%60parity%2F%60%20stays%20at%20the%20repository%20root.%0Afn%20repository_root%28%29%20-%3E%20PathBuf%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20let%20mut%20dir%20%3D%20PathBuf%3A%3Afrom%28env%21%28%22CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR%22%29%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20loop%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20dir.join%28%22parity%2Flanguage-features.lino%22%29.is_file%28%29%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20dir%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20assert%21%28%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20dir.pop%28%29%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%22could%20not%20locate%20parity%2Flanguage-features.lino%20from%20the%20crate%20manifest%22%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%